OL,3,AFrench police arrest 135 people, as
OL,4,Atens of thousands protest across
OL,5,Acountry
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrance's interior minister says that
OL,8,F135 people have been arrested as tens
OL,9,Fof thousands join protests across the
OL,10,Fcountry
OL,12,FPolice in Paris earlier seized weapons
OL,13,Fand gas masks in a crackdown;
OL,14,Fshopfronts are boarded up, and the
OL,15,Fcapital has closed a number of metro
OL,16,Fstations
OL,18,FOne protester in Paris tells the BBC:
OL,19,F"It's not Liberte, Egalite et
OL,20,FFraternite, it's injustice, inequality
OL,21,Fand privilege"
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
