OL,3,AFrench police arrest 135 people, as
OL,4,Atens of thousands protest across
OL,5,Acountry
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday's marches follow last weekend's
OL,8,Friots and looting that impacted
OL,9,Fthousands of businesses and saw more
OL,10,Fthan 2,700 arrested
OL,12,FCurfews, closures and protest bans are
OL,13,Fin place in cities including Paris,
OL,14,FMarseille and Lyon - although some
OL,15,Fdemonstrations are being allowed
